### The key idea

`.env` doesn't mean:

> **"Nobody can see this secret."**

It means:

> **"Don't put this secret inside your source code or commit it to Git. Keep it as deployment configuration."**

And in production, you can go one step further and use a proper **secret manager** instead of a `.env` file.
